<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Who are you?</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Bad Omens</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">THE DEATH OF PEACE OF MIND</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">1Gr0kbo4cgxYmhJa2lZX1a</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.150" end="00:27.050">Swimming pools made of gold, dive into the low end</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.050" end="00:32.050">I think I'm dreaming</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.050" end="00:37.850">Take off all of your clothes, hold me 'til we're frozen</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.850" end="00:41.370">'Til we can't feel it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.370" end="00:43.380" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.380" end="00:48.720">I asked for more than I could take</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.720" end="00:52.920">With nothing left to give</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.920" end="00:58.930">So who, who, who, who are you, you?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.930" end="01:04.580">Who, who, who are you?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.580" end="01:06.730">Every day it's all the same</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.730" end="01:08.810">I don't wanna play your games</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.810" end="01:12.320">If you wanna know, it depends who's asking</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.320" end="01:16.580">Who, who are you?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.580" end="01:24.580" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.330" end="01:31.080">One hundred to the nose, chase it with the potions</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.080" end="01:36.070">And now you're bleeding</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.070" end="01:41.550">Swerving over the road, eyes go out of focus</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.550" end="01:47.090">You love the feeling</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.090" end="01:52.430">You said we got nothing in common</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.430" end="01:57.770">Too bad never even got started</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.770" end="02:02.960">You said we got nothing in common</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.960" end="02:07.750">Too bad never even got started</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.750" end="02:13.530">So who, who, who, who are you, you?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.530" end="02:19.250">Who, who, who are you?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.250" end="02:21.440">Every day it's all the same</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.440" end="02:23.400">I don't wanna play your games</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.400" end="02:27.160">If you wanna know, it depends who's asking</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.160" end="02:31.500">Who, who are you?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.500" end="02:39.500" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:39.670" end="02:41.810">I've been finally catching up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:41.810" end="02:45.380">On years of sleep, the last few weeks, patiently</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:45.380" end="02:47.150">Falling outta love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:47.150" end="02:50.410">With you and me, and now it's too late to save it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:50.410" end="02:52.630">I've been finally catching up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:52.630" end="02:55.910">On years of sleep, the last few weeks, patiently</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:55.910" end="02:57.970">Falling outta love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:57.970" end="03:03.220">With you and me, and now it's too late to save it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:03.220" end="03:11.220" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:11.690" end="03:17.690">So who, who, who, who are you, you?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:17.690" end="03:23.390">Who, who, who are you?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:23.390" end="03:25.520">Every day it's all the same</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:25.520" end="03:27.430">I don't wanna play your games</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:27.430" end="03:31.080">If you wanna know, it depends who's asking</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:31.080" end="03:33.330">And now it's too late to save it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:33.330" end="03:37.330" /></div></body></tt>